cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the Application Note below."
title: "effn: effective sample size and minimum detectable effect for single-cell comparisons"
abstract: >-
  Converts a single-cell dataset with donor labels into an effective sample size,
  a minimum detectable effect, and a prescription of how many additional donors
  are required to support a target effect. The depth penalty is measured by
  resampling each donor's own cells at the depth that donor has, and the minimum
  detectable effect uses exact t quantiles at the design degrees of freedom.
